                  "left": 286.0,
                  "top": 804.0,
                  "width": 215,
                  "height": 64,
                  "text": "requireAuth verifies JWT then re-reads the account from\nMongoDB on every request, so deactivation / role change\ntakes effect immediately, not at token expiry."
                },
